# Dev Notes 16 — Runtime Lifecycle Model Reset Coordinator v1

Date: 2026-06-03
Branch: `runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-model-reset-coordinator`
Source base: `runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip`
Observed source ZIP SHA-256: `7f6bace7246d81471cc7901c15b1380f7d77ec1372b50ae5f4f0058a859bdf78`

## Status

```text
STAGED / MOCK-SANDBOX VERIFIED
```

These notes record the behavior-preserving model reset coordinator extraction from `inference.mjs`.

## Purpose

The purpose of this branch is to reduce `inference.mjs` responsibility load by moving parent-side model reset orchestration into:

```text
runtimeModelResetCoordinator.mjs
```

The public API export remains in `inference.mjs`:

```js
export async function resetModel() {
    return resetModelCoordinator({
        config,
        lifecycle,
        scheduler,
        sendToWorker,
        terminateWorker,
        recreateWorker,
        resolveNativeOperationHardStopConfig,
        assertRuntimeHealthy,
        markRuntimeUnhealthy,
        waitForNativeOperationBoundary,
        assertNoSessionResetInProgress,
        notifyRequestsCancellationRequested,
        cancelStream,
        traceCanceled,
        traceDelete,
        reinitializeModelAfterReset,
        createInitCoordinatorContext
    });
}
```

