No worker-local files were intentionally modified.

## Behavior moved

Moved from `inference.mjs` into `runtimeModelResetCoordinator.mjs`:

```text
runtime-health assertion before reset
runtimeResetting guard
runtimeShuttingDown guard
native hard-stop config resolution for model reset
session-reset-in-progress rejection
runtimeResetting flag set/clear
scheduler readiness freeze
cancel-all request settlement loop for model reset
parent-side cancellation notification for reset-canceled requests
worker cancel messages for reset-canceled requests
modelResetWaiter creation and cleanup
reset_model worker command
native operation boundary wait for model reset
runtime unhealthy marking on model reset timeout
session reset waiter/set clearing after successful reset boundary
worker termination after safe worker reset boundary
worker recreation after termination
post-reset re-init through the existing init coordinator helper
```

## Behavior intentionally not moved

The following remain in `inference.mjs`:

```text
public API exports
prompt admission and queueing
cancelPrompt fast path
resetSession public wrapper and coordinator context wiring
shutdownRuntime public wrapper and coordinator context wiring
worker message router
ready/init-error router handling
model_reset_done router handling
scheduler ownership
workerBridge ownership
init coordinator context construction
request cancellation notification helper shared by reset/session/shutdown
```

This branch intentionally does not extract the worker protocol router, scheduler, worker bridge, shutdown coordinator changes, session reset coordinator changes, init coordinator redesign, native hard-stop policy redesign, worker-local behavior, config override behavior, or cleanup-only refactors.

## Coordinator interface

`runtimeModelResetCoordinator.mjs` exports:

```js
export async function resetModelCoordinator(ctx) {}
```

`inference.mjs` supplies the coordinator with explicit dependencies instead of allowing the module to import parent runtime singletons directly.

## Behavior preservation notes

The extraction preserves the current parent-side model reset behavior:

```text
resetModel still rejects when runtime is unhealthy
resetModel still rejects during active runtime reset
resetModel still rejects during runtime shutdown
resetModel still rejects while a non-timed-out session reset is in progress
scheduler readiness is still set false before cancel-all settlement
all queued/running requests are still canceled with reason "Model reset"
parent MessageChannel cancellation notification still precedes worker cancel messages
worker cancel messages still include id, sessionId, and reason
streams still cancel before trace deletion
request done promises still reject with Error("Model reset")
modelResetWaiter is still installed before reset_model is sent
reset_model still waits through waitForNativeOperationBoundary
model reset timeout still marks the runtime unhealthy and requires process restart
session reset state is still cleared only after successful worker reset boundary
worker termination/recreation still happens only after cooperative reset boundary
post-reset re-init still uses reinitializeModelAfterReset(createInitCoordinatorContext())
runtimeResetting and modelResetWaiter are still cleared in finally
```

