## Recommended local real-runtime verification

Before merge readiness, run at least:

```bash
node ./tests/smokeTestLifecycleRegression.mjs
SMOKE_MODE=real-orchestrator node ./tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerNativeCancellationBoundary.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestHardwareAwareInitRetry.mjs
```

The highest-value real-runtime checks for this branch are:

```text
model reset idle and active paths
init -> resetModel -> prompt without prior prompt
reset after configOverride init
native hard-stop resetModel timeout behavior
worker-native resetModel cancellation boundary
hardware-aware init followed by resetModel/re-init behavior
```

